sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Saadaoui et al. (2020), Serra et al. (2023) & Rozbicki et al. (2015) avian gastrulation tensile ring, Polonaise twin-vortex flow & primitive streak attractor faithfully reproduces Gallus gallus (chick epiblast disc Stage EGK XII to HH3+ primitive streak formation) morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Gallus gallus (chick epiblast disc Stage EGK XII to HH3+ primitive streak formation) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.6/100, audit 2026-10-19-gastrulation-streak-attractor-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py; output: docs/media/gastrulation_streak_attractor_comparison.png; organism: Gallus gallus (chick epiblast disc Stage EGK XII to HH3+ primitive streak formation); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 394d38439dd8f3b351ba32f3eef22da12f99bfa222be7659901a95855eb8a1e1; artifact_sha256: cce5e534a176c23e53fdad8c43fd95d335edfe94e6092d94bb32edc36b060ac2; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-gastrulation-streak-attractor-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Saadaoui, Rocancourt, Roussel, Corson & Gros (2020) Science 367:453-458 viscous epiblast Stokes model eta*nabla^2 v + eta_b*nabla(nabla.v) = -nabla.(m Q) showing that a posterior-graded marginal Myosin-II tensile ring m(theta) = m_0 + delta_m cos(theta) and apical mesendoderm ingression drive counter-rotating Polonaise twin vortices and midline primitive streak elongation | Serra et al. (2023) Nat. Methods 20:1739-1748 mechanochemical active nematic feedback (Dm/Dt and DQ_{ij}/Dt) and Finite-Time Lyapunov Exponent (FTLE) Dynamic Morphogenetic Skeleton demonstrating transition from a wild-type linear streak to a circular ring under FGF receptor inhibition (SU5402) or twin streaks under ectopic Vg1/Wnt induction; reconstructed_in_script: 64x64 coupled 2D spectral viscous epiblast Stokes solver (Green's function L2 error = 5.97e-16) + active nematic Myosin-II cable advection-alignment PDE + Cauchy-Green FTLE attractor ridge integration across all 5 experimental regimes and a 15x15 (delta_m x beta_m) parameter morphospace | Automated computer-vision segmentation of HH1 Koller's sickle crescent (61x183 px, AP/ML = 0.3333), HH2 condensing mesendoderm (78x149 px, AP/ML = 0.5235), HH3+ primitive streak (135x81 px, AP/ML = 1.6667, 5.00x AP/ML elongation), area pellucida to area opaca radius ratio (0.6250 vs 0.6389 ref), and HH2 Polonaise PIV bilateral vortex symmetry (0.9705) on chick_primitive_streak_specimen.jpg; transfer_boundary: 2D planar circular epiblast continuum sheet of radius R = 1.15 mm calibrated to Saadaoui et al. (2020) light-sheet PIV speeds, Serra et al. (2023) FTLE attractors, and Vasiev et al. (2010) whole-blastoderm Wnt8c/Chordin micrographs; does_not_claim: Discrete 3D basement-membrane breakdown or individual bottle-cell mesenchymal migration after EMT ingression]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb3138>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-023-02009-y>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aaw1965>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0010571> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.926"^^xsd:double .

    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> ;
        schema:programmingLanguage "Python" ;
        schema:version "317bc3c" .
}

